Gauntlets of power is not enough. So, you need the Bag of Holding. I have
two problems with this solution. First, the Bag of Holding is a bug (it
will probably removed next version), second you need a bag of holding. It
would be nice if there is a difficult an dangerous way to enter the castle
without having something. My suggestion, make it always possible to carry
a boulder (strength unimportant) when you carry nothing. Then you can move
23 boulders (there are plenty of boulders) to the castle and enter it. This
is of course very dangerous because you are walking naked and so it does not
affect the game significant.

